desc(
	mode: "struct"
	language: "java"
	title: "Struct scan: Java XMLInputFactory newInstance"
	title_zh: "结构扫描：Java XMLInputFactory 默认实例"
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "struct-java-xmlinputfactory"
	risk: "xxe"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
检测到 XMLInputFactory.newInstance。默认可能解析外部实体。

### 风险类型
xxe

### 影响
该用法属于已知危险 API 或弱密码学配置，可能被用于绕过校验、执行代码或泄露机密。

### 检测方式
结构扫描在编译单元内匹配真实调用，而不是注释或字符串字面量。
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
禁用 IS_SUPPORTING_EXTERNAL_ENTITIES 和 SUPPORT_DTD。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://X.java": <<<POS
import javax.xml.stream.XMLInputFactory;
class X {
  void bad() { XMLInputFactory.newInstance(); }
}

POS
	"safefile://S.java": <<<NEG
class S { void ok() { System.out.println("safe-xml"); } }

NEG
)

XMLInputFactory.newInstance() as $call
XMLInputFactory.newFactory() as $call
alert $call for {
	level: "high",
	title: "Struct scan: Java XMLInputFactory newInstance",
	title_zh: "结构扫描：Java XMLInputFactory 默认实例",
	message: "结构扫描：Java XMLInputFactory 默认实例",
	risk: "xxe",
}
